The {{Term/Store|Of the Wild Set||Series, TotK}},{{Exp Game|TotK}}<ref name="TotK Piggyback 405"/> also known as the {{Term/Store|Hero of the Wild Set||BotW}},{{Exp Game|BotW}}<ref name="CaC 186"/> is a recurring [[Armor Set]] in {{TLoZ Series}}. The Of the Wild Set goes unnamed in {{SSBU}} and {{AoC}}.

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Hero of the Wild Set is comprised of three pieces of [[Armor]], consisting of the Cap of the Wild, Tunic of the Wild, and Trousers of the Wild. The three pieces will be awarded upon completing all 120 [[Ancient Shrine]]s and is the objective of the "[[A Gift from the Monks]]" [[Side Quest]]. The design is said to be passed down from the distant past based on a hero who is said to have a similar outfit.<ref name="CaC 186"/>

The Set can be enhanced by visiting one of the various [[Great Fairy|Great Fairies]] and can be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]]. When enhanced by two levels, it provides [[Master Sword Beam Up]].

====Dye Options====
{{Dye/Set|BotW|Cap of the Wild|Tunic of the Wild|Trousers of the Wild}}

====Enhancing====
{{Armor Set Pieces|BotW|Hero of the Wild Set}}

==={{TotK|-}}===
The Of the Wild Set is composed of three pieces of [[Armor]], consisting of the Cap of the Wild, Tunic of the Wild, and Trousers of the Wild. The three pieces are awarded from [[Treasure Chest]]s inside the [[Eldin Dark Skeleton]], the [[Gerudo Dark Skeleton]], and the [[Hebra Dark Skeleton]] respectively, under the [[Eldin Great Skeleton]], the [[Gerudo Great Skeleton]], and the [[Hebra Great Skeleton]] on the [[Surface]], in the [[Depths]].

The Set can be enhanced by visiting one of the various [[Great Fairy|Great Fairies]] and can be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]]. When enhanced by two levels, it provides [[Attack Up]].

